poxchat (3.0.0~alpha2-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Second alpha. Virtual scrollback hardening and zstd-VFS crash
    resilience with salvage tooling; reply, reaction and typing-indicator
    polish; image upload; window-state persistence. CI now produces
    Windows (portable zip + installer, with bundled Lua and Python
    scripting) and macOS artifacts alongside the Linux packages.

