poxchat (3.0.0~alpha1-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * First alpha of the PoxChat fork. PoxChat is a GTK4 fork of HexChat
    with expanded IRCv3 support. The Closes: line will be added once
    the ITP bug against wnpp is filed.
  * Initial Debian packaging.

